From e7ee336c1c0c6f7d00c2102bf77d6647c85b9531 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: phaer <hello@phaer.org>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 16:53:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] hwdb: fix the IMDS paths for Hetzner Cloud

The Hetzner Cloud metadata service serves the user data at
/hetzner/v1/userdata, next to /hetzner/v1/metadata rather than below
it, and it has no /public-keys/0: the SSH keys are only available as a
JSON array at /hetzner/v1/metadata/public-keys. Both paths return 404,
and systemd-imds-import.service fails.

Move the data URL one level up, prefix the metadata keys with
/metadata, and drop IMDS_KEY_SSH_KEY, as there is no key that returns a
single plain SSH key.

Assisted-by: Claude Code (claude-opus-5-5)
---
 hwdb.d/40-imds.hwdb | 11 +++++------
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/hwdb.d/40-imds.hwdb b/hwdb.d/40-imds.hwdb
index 2cd08bddb6..d31e12a436 100644
--- a/hwdb.d/40-imds.hwdb
+++ b/hwdb.d/40-imds.hwdb
@@ -76,9 +76,8 @@ dmi:bvnHetzner:*
  IMDS_VENDOR=hetzner-cloud
- IMDS_DATA_URL=http://169.254.169.254/hetzner/v1/metadata
+ IMDS_DATA_URL=http://169.254.169.254/hetzner/v1
  IMDS_ADDRESS_IPV4=169.254.169.254
- IMDS_KEY_HOSTNAME=/hostname
- IMDS_KEY_REGION=/region
- IMDS_KEY_ZONE=/availability-zone
- IMDS_KEY_IPV4_PUBLIC=/public-ipv4
- IMDS_KEY_SSH_KEY=/public-keys/0
+ IMDS_KEY_HOSTNAME=/metadata/hostname
+ IMDS_KEY_REGION=/metadata/region
+ IMDS_KEY_ZONE=/metadata/availability-zone
+ IMDS_KEY_IPV4_PUBLIC=/metadata/public-ipv4
  IMDS_KEY_USERDATA=/userdata
-- 
